---
const version = __APP_VERSION__;
const build = new Date(__BUILD_TIME__);
const human = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("ja-JP", {
  year: "numeric",
  month: "2-digit",
  day: "2-digit",
  hour: "2-digit",
  minute: "2-digit",
  hour12: false,
  timeZone: "Asia/Tokyo",
}).format(build);
---

<footer>
  <div class="footer-content">
    <div class="copy-right">
      <p>
        せの (@senox78) — Licensed under&nbsp;
        <a
          href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link--underline link--external"
        >
          CC BY 4.0</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="site-info">
      <p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Uliboooo/blog"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link--underline link--external">View Source</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="why-snails">
    <div class="why-snail-c">
      <h2>Why "Compute on Snails" ?</h2>
      <p>
        ハードウェアに依らない抽象化された計算機を、「計算機の要件を満たすのならばカタツムリの上で計算してもいい」という<span
          >冗談</span
        >から。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    font-family: var(--base-fonts-sans);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-left: 10px;
    padding-right: 10px;

    /* flex-wrap: wrap; */
    gap: 1rem;

    .footer-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      /* align-items: center; */
    }

    .why-snails {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-start;

      .why-snail-c {
        /* width: 75%; */
        h2 {
          margin-top: 0;
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
        p {
          font-size: 0.8rem;
          text-wrap: pretty;
          /* auto-phrase 非対応ブラウザ向けの fallback は normal。
             keep-all だと日本語が折り返せず1行が伸びて溢れる */
          word-break: normal;
          word-break: auto-phrase;
        }
      }
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    footer {
      .footer-content {
        gap: 0.2rem;
      }

      .why-snails {
        .why-snail-c {
          p {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
